  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Tell which line is the best fit for the data and give an explanation why it is the best fit.</para>
<para dir="ltr"><figure><media alt="TWO SCATTER PLOTS WITH X-AXIS LABEL OF INDEPENDENT VARIABLE AND Y-AXIS LABEL OF RESPONSE VARIABLE. SCATTER PLOT ON THE LEFT SHOWS FIVE PLOTTED POINTS AND THE LINE Y EQUALS NEGATIVE NINE-TENTHS X PLUS FORTY-FIVE. SCATTER PLOT ON THE RIGHT SHOWS THE SAME PLOTTED POINTS AND THE LINE Y EQUALS NEGATIVE SEVEN-TENTHS X PLUS FORTY.&#10;"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/3b43ba9edd46cc53324b4af31bd6c874968b60ef"/></media></figure></para></section>
